1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
Bunyi tek di atap tengah malam?

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,280
Bukan hantu.

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:07,200
Siang tadi, atap seng panasnya lebih dari 40 derajat.

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,280
Kena panas, besi memanjang.

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,920
Malam dingin, besi mengkerut lagi.

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,800
Besi atap 6 meter bisa mengkerut sampai 2 milimeter.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,480
Tapi sekrupnya nahan.

8
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:20,440
Ditahan, ditahan, terus lepas.

9
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:20,880
Tek!

10
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,480
Kayak jentik jari.

11
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,520
Siang ramai, nggak kedengeran.

12
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,800
Malam sepi, baru kedengeran.

13
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:31,600
Jadi yang bunyi bukan penunggu rumah, tapi atapmu yang lagi kedinginan.

14
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,000
Bunyinya pindah-pindah kayak orang jalan?

15
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,280
Itu beda.

16
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,800
Cek tikus atau musang.

17
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:37,800
Mau bukti?

18
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,720
Siang nanti, dengar pas matahari ketutup awan.

19
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,400
Atap mendadak dingin, bunyi juga.

20
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,840
Yang tiap malam takut sama bunyi atap, perlu tahu ini.

21
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,080
Atap rumahmu sering bunyi jam berapa?

22
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,360
Follow buat fakta rumah berikutnya!
